{
  "_comment": "Copy this file and rename it to store-deploy.json to apply it. Precedence: manual run input > this file > repo variables (ANDROID_/IOS_DEPLOY_MODE) > store_only. deploy_mode: store_only (up to internal testing · TestFlight) | store_prepare (production draft · right before ASC submission) | store_submit (submits for review automatically, cannot be undone). ⚠️ On push (automatic deploy), store_prepare · store_submit are lowered to store_only unless auto_submit_on_push is true — a new deploy arriving during review restarts that review (#816). Production and App Store review go out through a manual run. promote_closed_testing (android, default true) = also release to closed testing on every push. review_cooldown_hours (android, default 48) = for this many hours after a manual production submission, push skips the closed and open testing promotions. production_rollout is android only (greater than 0 and at most 1.0, 1.0 = full rollout).",
  "android": {
    "deploy_mode": "store_only",
    "promote_closed_testing": true,
    "review_cooldown_hours": 48,
    "auto_submit_on_push": false,
    "production_rollout": "1.0"
  },
  "ios": {
    "deploy_mode": "store_only",
    "auto_submit_on_push": false
  }
}
